00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:08.200
CHRISTOPHER CROSBIE:
I spend a lot

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.040
of my time building security
features in Cloud Dataproc,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.520
which is, if you're
not familiar,

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.020
our managed Hadoop and Spark
